03", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_774312788169636_8407136546126498352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BZJZmURLRRAQ7kNvwHCRhJt&_nc_oc=AdrzwghTMEaDQuWWpdIzx8fT1NWWzyGJzwqjKXX7qrOOdiF-kPg2whfm13a4W0YsdvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNgbHzTJjeE5kqhIO8slg8txDLVhbqaacGzqj343BzHRg&oe=6ADF4A26"}]}, "id": "1377969980485338", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SC26.png", "id": "964420118677466", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_964420125344132_7279037948266946186_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RJEwc_6Kz3gQ7kNvwFHpsuF&_nc_oc=AdoEyZcYb8Dy71gqgSQqQJtZ_2NKsQ-6NKYpfml1FLOdT4Yr2PM5mYetPX7ujCf0mcY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPLDpXUz0VwWtptaymL7bNh1WVoA5NZ8GYlTo37Q-rSzQ&oe=6ADF5545"}, {"file_name": "SC19.png", "id": "1028550412168366", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031459_1028550415501699_7667063941983084531_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uGXJHJfXEt4Q7kNvwErXOCG&_nc_oc=Adog7936CSfvzdz1tkCVh4u3LwCT_xrjhiKQpMgQfrOfKo6cGQxdN4QnyECMRU3CVbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPgMbeC7rLc67AAuutNkB-hrR0fpTuPB2TOQXOvZFbziQ&oe=6ADF52EC"}, {"file_name": "SC6.png", "id": "1213008986735069", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_1213008990068402_721949442093583782_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9w2Az2Un7TgQ7kNvwF2j25L&_nc_oc=AdpEwU1u6_ww61lVb-wySwX5azEX5zJ4KtJA61_5ZOK6pGBQcy0XetYq22XsRpPngEw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNW08ewJDpZqukXBRfmA0g-CY_kpCCYlk6vUyb5HeSnJw&oe=6ADF66A0"}, {"file_name": "SC25.png", "id": "2182709462063835", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_2182709465397168_1136481695964559917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mwl11Xx_CfUQ7kNvwHmscGo&_nc_oc=AdrhHquTgCVDw-zfS9qvQcFjxd0wVvs3JRRNVysgQPmYsue86QP4Pt7lJSHXJOSQ6d8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPP0OrTLzvDo8qQOhhedN_AtWKdBHpuzOUTDJ_xcRu-4w&oe=6ADF5BB6"}, {"file_name": "SC11.png", "id": "1020526033014243", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_1020526036347576_3573329723363051043_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UVhWwsbzDBAQ7kNvwGMg14P&_nc_oc=Adqk0kPIF3UD8WmHfQVbQyqkK5uJsoS1vQBn3Zklr7IDtWrnWeXyzurTXepkNPsCBWY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPcpd4AGf8pT9XBvcg90HJqSgN5PyiM1jKzr8InZpfYTQ&oe=6ADF512F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1670277503511368", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_1670277506844701_2413630122857125207_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xhttn3gZiUkQ7kNvwGg2LPl&_nc_oc=AdrvMwXSPlsiK-uQ2rm0Zldqy1oCDm8rzPikmqQPb5z4AyPFAXmaX2PgU-dZtt2mlk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOZlx8zliMFVwbd-Nsx8Yc-W3sNBVWW7j2tNIwds085uA&oe=6ADF61D5"}, "display_name": "Venture's Gauntlet: Ultimate VR Fitness", "keywords": ["fitness", "adventure", "obstacle", "story", "platformer"], "long_description": "# VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer\n\nObsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: **Venture\u2019s Gauntlet**\n\n{960204795511693}\n\n# Comfortable Locomotion \n\nRun, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with **TrueMotionVR** arm swing controls.\n\n\n# Overcome Dangerous Challenges\n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.\n\n{472666925095689}\n\n# Embark On An Epic Journey\n\nTraverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.\n\n{2173852816328585}\n\n# Breathtaking Visuals\n\nExperience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.\n\n{408266168650091}\n\n# Uncover the secrets of the Ventures\n\nThe ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him, or will you be a disappointment like all the others?\n\n{1446632349279537}\n\n# Tailor Made Courses\n\nCalibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height & arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.\n\n# Claim the ultimate glory\n\nCompete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.\n\nSo ask yourself this -  do **YOU** have what it takes to run the Gauntlet?\n\nWe think you can do it!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is an intense parkour & obstacle course game that features arm swing movement, climbing, archery, moving lasers, shooter drones, shields, and more.  \n\nPlaying the game is an immersive physical experience, a test of both fitness and skill because you are the one running, climbing, and dodging through challenging courses!  \n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive and claim Adam Venture's fortune.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "BearHammer Games Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"